### Meal Polls V2 - Voter (synchronisation des choix)
# NOTE: option_ids doit contenir exactement `max_votes_per_user` options.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/meal-polls/{{meal_poll_id}}/votes/sync
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "option_ids": [{{meal_poll_option_id}}]
}

### Meal Polls V2 - Cloturer le sondage (Parent)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/meal-polls/{{meal_poll_id}}/close
Accept: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
# Attendu:
# - statut du sondage => closed
# - notification type poll_needs_validation pour le parent validateur
# - notification type poll_closed_too_late pour les membres qui n'ont pas voté

### Meal Polls V2 - Valider les resultats + meal plan
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/meal-polls/{{meal_poll_id}}/validate
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "selected_recipe_ids": [{{meal_poll_recipe_id}}],
  "meal_plan": [
    {
      "date": "2026-02-20",
      "meal_type": "soir",
      "recipe_id": {{meal_poll_recipe_id}},
      "servings": 4
